From 22245c643e8a849c6f1db2e2aa45538fae692f88 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Russell Ballestrini <russell@unturf.com>
Date: Fri, 10 Oct 2026 12:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 14/29] b43: AC-PHY: HT (802.11n, MCS 0..7) on core rev >= 40

HT RX and TX on the AC core: the HT capabilities, the HT rate entry in the
AC TX header (PLCP, PHY control words, MCS, short GI), HT RX reporting,
the ucode 907 rate tables and the 5 GHz channel table of the R6400's wl.ko.
Verified on the Netgear R6400 against a 2x2 client at MCS 7, 20 MHz.
---
